                                "sense_id": "6744625d-9a8a-3d9d-9647-5354205ccb3d",
                                "text": "I have tried to explain the sense of dynamis fundamental to Aristotle's philosophy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3995fcd3-d4a0-4119-b705-84cf35a6dfe8",
                                "sense_id": "6744625d-9a8a-3d9d-9647-5354205ccb3d",
                                "text": "Heidegger deals in this text with Aristotle's attempt to explicate dynamis and energeia as one of manifold ways in which being is expressed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9356009b-f6de-44cf-98a2-020f2b5bc22b",
                                "sense_id": "6744625d-9a8a-3d9d-9647-5354205ccb3d",
                                "text": "Like Heidegger's Aristotle, Marcuse argues that being “reveals” itself in the relation of dynamis to energeia."
                            }
